Numbers 15:20\" href=\"/Numbers.15.20\">Nu 15:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:21\" href=\"/Numbers.15.21\">21</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.30\">Ez 44:30b</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.38\">Ne 10:38</a>, wool <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.4\">Dt 18:4</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־תְּבוּאָחֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.9\">Pr 3:9</a>; Israel is <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ תְּבוּאָתֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.3\">Je 2:3</a> (i.e. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s increase); <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> = <em>first-fruits</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.12\">Lv 2:12</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:12\" href=\"/Numbers.18.12\">Nu 18:12</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:44\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.44\">Ne 12:44</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.14\">Ez 48:14</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>first, chief</em>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:1\" href=\"/Amos.6.1\">Am 6:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ גְּבוּרָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.35\">Je 49:35</a> (of bows); so appar. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ בְּנֵי עַמּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:41\" href=\"/Daniel.11.41\">Dn 11:41</a>, i.e. the principal part of them (Buhl Marti conj. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵרִית</span>, after 𝔖); <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ מַשְׂאוֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:40\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.40\">Ez 20:40</a>, i.e. your chief oblations; <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ שְׁמָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:6\" href=\"/Amos.6.6\">Am 6:6</a>, i.e. choice oils; = choice part, of land <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.21\">Dt 33:21</a>, offering <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.29\">1 S 2:29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֵרֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.21\">15:21</a>; abs. <em>chief thing</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.7\">Pr 4:7</a> (of wisdom)."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB09078","strong_numbers":["7225"],"next_hw":"מָרֵאשָׁה²","prev_hw":"רַאֲשׁוֹת","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8040"],"TWOT":["2097e"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}